define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/destructor> {
    it also assigns the action</forwarder>.
    it also assigns the position</implied>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is being destroyed.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in action</forwarder>::position<trigger_pos>.
        create a particle in position</implied>.
        destroy the particle in position</implied>.
    }
}
